our friends can use light-hearted weapons, devices, superpowers, and more to beat up on your Buddy ragdoll, earn money, and unlock even more powerful weapons. Every moment is packed with absurd over-the-top destruction!\n\n# 50+ Weapons to Unlock\nEndlessly satisfying demolition with tons of epic items.\n{1555781618784552}\n\n# Multiplayer Mayhem with Friends\nPublic and private lobbies to unleash a diabolical beatdown on the buddies (or each other).\n{1597570284565220}\n\n# Buddy & Dungeon Customization\nDeck your buddy out with some swag, or yourself. Or both! Deliver a beatdown and look stylish while doing it.\n{1155868096698015}\n\n# 6 Maps to Explore (And More Coming)\nTest out your parkour in our topsy-turvy maps. Set up perfectly for combos and trickshots.\n{713710701362136}\n\n# Join Our Discord!\nFind others to play with, vote on new weapons, share your videos, and get special access to new updates and giveaways (https://dsc.gg/buddybeatdown).", "short_description": "The Ultimate FREE Stress Relief Sandbox with Multiplayer! \n\nYou and your friends can use light-hearted weapons, devices, superpowers and more to beat up on your Buddy ragdoll, earn money, and unlock even more powerful weapons. Every moment is packed with absurd over-the-top destruction!\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "2080 Games, Armored Pig Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.2080.games/game-buddy-beatdown-vr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "2080 Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.2080.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection